// swag type overrides, read by `make swagger` (swag's default
// overrides file).
//
// json.RawMessage is a []byte, which swag describes as []integer —
// every descriptor (xFormat, part ui, type layout), every raw record
// and every records array reached clients as number[]. Describing it
// as an object fixes all of them at once; a per-field
// swaggertype:"array,object" segfaults swag v2 rc5 on []RawMessage.
//
// Fields whose RawMessage holds a leaf rather than an object (the
// per-path PATCH `set` maps) carry swaggertype:"object", which wins
// over this.
replace json.RawMessage map[string]interface{}
